<title>UK: MS sets warrants on Italian insurance basket.</title>
<headline>MS sets warrants on Italian insurance basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on an Italian insurnace basket comprising Generali, Ras, Alleanza and Sai, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International Ltd said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   2 YEARS		   PAYDATE	11.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE	    ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A    100,000.00 ITL  18,600.00 ITL  18.60 PCT    5.38 X</p>
<p> CALL B    110,000.00 ITL  14,000.00 ITL  24.00 PCT    7.14 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
